nce with Team Rocket. Petty theft, intimidation, and ridiculous grand schemes we'll thwart again and again! Bahaha!",More Team Rocket! I'll defeat you both!"No, my sweet puppy!"mYou'll pay for this, just you wait. The rest of the force will have you in handcuffs before you know it!"EAre you the reinforcement I called for? Help me fight this thug!"You're doing good, rookie!"�Have you been catching Pokémon on the island? These Pokémon belong in the wild. Please give them to me so I can release them. I'll reward you!";Come back to me if you decide to relase your Pokémon."dThat's a great specimen! Are you sure you want to release it? You won't be able to get it back."wThank you, \V[2] will live a happy life in the wilds of Pinkan Island! Here's a little something for your trouble."<Come back to me if you decide to release your Pokémon."cWait- no. Pinkan Island is a dangerous place, you need to keep at least one Pokémon with you."BIt's a Pinkan Berry bush. There's a ripe berry you can steal!"=It's a bush full of Pinkan Berries. Better keep it safe!"3Are you sure you're on the right side of this?"8You're way too competent to be a cop! What a waste."@It's too bad, you would've made a great Team Rocket member."(Quick, help me defeat this officer!"HI can't believe these dirty cops train attack dogs like that! Phew."3Thanks, \V[25], you saved my hide right there!"fYou'll make better use of this than me. I'll, uhh, hang back while you search for Pinkan Berries."SLeave it to these criminals to sic their vermin on an officer like that! Phew."3Thanks, newbie, you saved my hide right there!"[You'll make better use of this than me. I'll cover you while you look for more grunts."QGo on, find those Pinkan Berries! I'll, uhh, watch your back from over here."SGo on, find the rest of the Team Rocket grunts. I'll cover you from over here."2You are siding with Team Rocket. Switch side?"1You are siding with the police. Switch side?"You're under arrest!"And so are you!"Don't hurt the 