 be able to live it down!"nThe boss went back to his family to re-energize for a while , but he'll be back soon, stronger than ever!""Don't try to chase after him!"\I came here to meditate on all the cruel and awful things I've done with Team Rocket..."hThere are many decisions I've made which I now regret deeply. But alas, the damage is already done."wAll I can do is to be a better person from now on and dedicate the rest of my life to helping people and Pokémon."sI do have a lot more free time now that I've retired from Team Rocket... Would you like to fight me once more?"gVery well. I will wait for you at the Fighting Arena, in Vermillion City. I hope to see you there.")It's a drumset made out of... rocks?""It sounds like an earthquake!"RWhere does the boss' family live? Somewhere in Johto I think. Why do you ask?"?This town is so small it doesn't even appear on most maps!"eAs you know, the organization has sustained significant losses following the Silph Co. incident."eAnd so I must retreat back with my family to reflect on the future of Team Rocket for some time."MI must ask that you do not try to follow me or to contact me in any way."YI shall be the one who will make contact when the time is right. Is that understood?"Yes boss!"Of course."&Very well then, farewell for now.[%""Grr grr grmmm, grr grr grmmm."Graooow?"/\PN a parlé aux Pokémon du groupe \V[1]."Grr grr grooaaoo!"\PN..."FFuahahaha! J'imagine que tu ne t'attendais pas à me trouver ici."CJe suis venu ici pour méditer sur l'avenir de la Team Rocket."|Nous avions de grands projets pour le monde, mais tu n'as eu de cesse de nous empêcher de passer à la vitesse supérieure."MTu es donc venu jusqu'ici pour trouver le Champion d'Arène de Jadielle?"C'est en effet moi."RTrès bien. Je vais retourner à Jadielle et te combattre une dernière fois."�Je n'ai peut-être plus les oiseaux légendaires ou Mewtwo à mes côtés, mais je n'ai pas l'intention de perdre cette fois-ci!"'Nous nous reverrons bientôt, \PN."I