 getting lost again..."BExcuse me, but could you please tell me where Violet City is?"@Oh, I'm sorry. I just have a terrible sense of orientation!"9It's East? Thank you! I'll head there straight away!":It's South? Thank you! I'll head there straight away!"It's locked..." \V[25], what are you doing?"0You need to wear your uniform at all times!"_\V[25]! As I was telling the other grunts, there's gonna be a lot of police on the island."kWe can't risk tracking them tracking us down, so you'll have to leave your bag and your Pokémon here.".Looks like we're all set. Everyone ready?""For the glory of Team Rocket!"MHurry up! We gotta go soon if we want to get a head start on the police!"\V[154]"EI've been thinking of opening a Game Corner in this city. Hmm...">Now, which of these buildings would make a good location?"UThank you for helping us thwart Team Rocket on Pinkan Island. You're a good kid."RYou came all the way from Pallet Town in Kanto? That's awfully far from here!"This is exciting!"mUgh, this is getting worse by the day. First Celadon City and now they're stirring trouble offshore too!"oYeah, it's a nature preserve! They think they can just barge in and take what they want? Not on our watch."2Oh! This is the Celadon kid I told you about!"zHey kid! Did you think about what I asked you back in Celadon? We need all the help we can get for this next mission."Hmm.. Wait a second..."OHmm... hold on. I recognize you! You're the kid who reported those crimes!"=I recognize you! You're the kid who reported that crime!"�So you've been working undercover, trying to take down Team Rocket from within, huh? That's pretty impressive for someone your age."�How about putting those skills to better use? We've got an important mission coming up, and we could use someone with your talent."pHey kid! Did you think about what I asked you about? We need all the help we can get for this next mission.""Excellent, come with us then."IWe'll be leaving soon, just come and see us if you 