o play? You'll have to do a 5-round game if you want a chance at winning the \C[1]special prize\C[0]!"NJoin us whenever you can for a chance to win the \C[1]special prize\C[0]!"6Fantastic! Okay, we're live in 3..\.. 2..\.. 1..."[I'm your host, Mary, and today we have \PN who's joining us as a returning contestant."6Let's see how they fare in this \V[1]-round game!"&Another great performance by \PN!"iAmazingly! \PN managed to top 5,000 points so they've earned themselves the \C[1]special prize\C[0]!"�That's right! The special prize is a Teleporter! It's a portable device that allows you to warp to any city without using a Pokémon. How lucky!"�You didn't manage to score over 5,000 points so I cannot give you the special prize, but you can still spend your points with my associate for our smaller prizes."MYou can't win all them! Let's hope \PN's next attempt goes a bit better!"�Which difficulty would you like to try? In Advanced you don't get multiple choices, but you'll win much more points when you get it right!"7Great, and how many rounds would you like to play?"�Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the most electrifying game show on the airwaves! It's time for the "Guess That Fusion Quiz Show" once again!"KHere's a bonus prize for obtaining over 5,000 points in a single game!"OAnd here's a bonus prize for obtaining over 8,000 points in a single game!"VAnd here's another bonus prize for obtaining over 12,000 points in a single game!"PI've never seen anyone obtain such a high score in the history of the game!"NHere's our grand prize for obtaining over 25,000 points in a single game!"JLadies and gentlemen, \PN surpassed what I even thought was possible!"MHere's another grand prize for obtaining 35,000 points in a single game!"b...And another one for a perfect game on the highest difficulty! That's no small achievement!";Join us next time for some more Guess That Fusion fun!"Statistics"Scoring system"Never mind"Yes"No"3 rounds"5 rounds"Regular"Advanced"10 rou