re's nothing we can do!"(Mr. Fuji? What are you doing here?!"$I'm here to put an end to this!"eTeam Rocket has created a virus that causes Pokémon to fuse with each other against their will!"kIt's highly contagious and they want to use the Cinnabar volcano to spread it around the Kanto region!"Is this true, Giovanni?"+Why would you want to do such a thing?"8Well, it looks like our plans have been discovered."SIf we release this virus into the wild, the economy of the region will thrive."|Kanto would become renowned for its incredible diversity of Pokémon and trainers from all around the world would come here."?Which of course would be great for Team Rocket's business."_I can release the virus right now at the press of only a few buttons on this very machine."2I have to agree with Mr. Fuji here, Giovanni."WThis is absolutely insane and completely irresponsible! We cannot let you do that!"Oh, is that so Professor?"Well in that case..."BWhy don't you give our guests here a taste of what's to come?">What!? How were you able to defeat those fused Pokémon!?"How annoying."WThough I have to admit, those are some impressive battling skills for two old men."&But now let's get this over with."4Mewtwo, won't you please come greet our guests."I... I don't believe it!"How..."How could it be?".It looks like you were able to stop me..."2I must admit, I really did not see it coming."�Still, I might not have been able to spread the virus around the region, but we plan on marketing DNA Splicers and making them easily available for all trainers."BPokémon fusion is still about to become reality nonetheless!":So, what did you think of Mewtwo? Powerful, isn't it?"&So, are you impressed, professor?"Hmm..."[I will now go on with the plan and use Cinnabar Island's volcano to release the virus."1Soon fused Pokemon will be found everywhere."MAnd there's absolutely nothing that you two old men can do about it now!"XPokémon are sentient beings, you cannot just force two of them into a 