liar with them!"$You're looking for some bricks?"sSure, I've got them. But I'm not handing them to you unless you beat me in a Pokémon battle! What do you say?"*Watch out, I'm not going down easily!"-Woah! You're way better than I expected!"4You're good. Here are the bricks you asked for!"9I'm not giving you these bricks unless you fight me!"+So, what were those bricks for anyway?"9I'm quite grateful for your help with this Oricorio!"RI'll make sure to tend to all these flowers you brought with the utmost care."OWhen you're having trouble in a trainer battle, you're allowed to forfeit!"DYou should always stop by the hotel when you get to a new city."RThey're always full of people seeking help from travelling Pokémon trainers!"&Did you check out the Museum yet?"1Those fossils were incredible, weren't they?""Which one was your favourite?"$Really!? You really have to go!"\The entrance is free and there's huge collection of rare fossils from around the world!"Yes"NoIu;␀G[[4"DTch-tch-tch! I made a cool move. It can cause all kinds of fun!"AIt's called Metronome. Want me to teach it to your Pokémon?"2Tch-tch-tch! That's the sound of a Metronome!"FIt tweaks your Pokémon's brain into using moves it doesn't know!"XThat's too bad. Come back whenever you want me to teach it to one of your Pokémon!"Oh... That's too bad."NWe're not just a museum, we also do lots of research on Pokémon fossils!"HWe have a machine that can revive prehistoric Pokémon from fossil!"=Let me know when you want us to revive a fossil for you."ROh, I'm sorry, but our fossil reviving machine cannot extract DNA from amber."qYou'll have to go to a more sophisticated laboratory for that, like the one in Cinnabar Island for instance."/Okay. I'll see if I can revive your \v[3]."<Come back around \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."H... But unfortunately, the machine isn't operational at the moment."QWe're trying our best to get it back to a working state as soon as possible!"}Oh \PN, I'm so sorry to 