ing to make an omelette."LWon't you find me an egg so that I can make it happen? Any egg will do!" Thanks! I can hardly wait!!"GFind me a Pokémon egg so I can make an omelette! Any egg will do!"<You can't make an omelette without breaking a few eggs!"=So, did you bring me a Pokémon egg to make my omelette?"\PN handed over the egg."DYes! This egg should make some fine omelette thank you so much!"YAs a thanks, I'll teach the move Softboiled to one of your Pokémon. Free of charge!",Just come see me whenever you're ready!"BAs promised, I'll teach the move Softboiled to your Pokémon!"Ta-da! Isn't that great?"YSoftboiled is a great move! It uses the power of partially boiled eggs to regain HP."_It can even be used out of battle to heal your other Pokémon! Just be wary of salmonella!"3I'm conducting a study on the Pokémon Eevee ."iCould you show me the Pokémon that Eevee evolves into when it's exposed to one of these two stones?"'Could you show me such a Pokémon?"mCould you show me the Pokémon that Eevee evolves into when it's exposed to a Moon Stone or a Sun Stone?" Hmm.. No, that won't do it."VHmm.. Interesting. So Eevee evolves into Espeon when it's exposed to a Sun Stone."XHmm.. Interesting. So Eevee evolves into Umbreon when it's exposed to a Moon Stone."@This information will be very useful to my research indeed.";Thank you for helping me out. I want you to have these"Super Splicers are a prototype that is still being developped at Silph Co. It hasn't even been released to the public yet!"1Argh! This is a huge setback on my research!"tEevee will also evolve into Leafeon or Glaceon when it's exposed to a Leaf Stone or an Ice Stone, respectively."Yes"No[�"�J'ai envoyé mon frère dans la région de Johto pour enquêter sur une étrange structure en pierre. On pense qu'elle est connectée à un mystère de quelque sorte."~Mais dans ma hâte, j'ai oublié de lui donner cette pierre. Je pense qu'elle peut être la clé pour résoudre cette énigme."5Est-ce que tu pourrais lui d