t Scale."BOh... You don't have enough Heart Scales. That's unfortunate."No worries!"1Heart Scales are worth more than gold to me!"JA stranger from Unova sold me this egg, but I can't seem to hatch it."BOh, you're a Trainer! That means you're using Pokémon Boxes!"gMy name's Bebe! You know the PC Pokémon Boxes? I'm the system administrator in the Sinnoh region!"OI'm helping Celio install a new connection to Sinnoh's PC Storage network."OWe're almost done setting it up, but we're missing an important component."`Celio says he might've dropped it on Treasure Beach when he got spooked by a wild Oricorio.""Argh, this is so frustrating!"4Oh.. Could this be the missing network adapter?"It is! You're a lifesaver!"/Here, let me just install this real quick."1Ok, now I just need to sync it with your PC."It worked perfectly!"8Finally, the \C[1]Box Link\C[0] is now operational!"NThis is a portable device that allows you to access the PC from anywhere!"lWell now if you excuse me, I have to go set up the PCs on the other islands, so I'll have to get going."Bye Celio! See ya, \PN!"zWhat a disaster! I was attacked by a pack of bird Pokémon on my way from Treasure Beach and I lost the Network Chip!"dIt's an essential component to the new communication system we're installing. This is terrible!"{What a disaster! I was attacked by a pack of bird Pokémon on my way from Treasure Island and I lost the Network Chip!"2Thank you for finding this Network Chip, \PN!"bThis machine here links to PC Pokémon Storage System of the Sevii Islands with the mainland."1The system is now operational thanks to you!"9\^Hello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center.\wt[2.5]"=\^We restore your tired Pokémon to full health.\wt[2.5]"*Would you like to rest your Pokémon?"3OK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow excep