ieux!?"KJe pense que quelqu'un essaie de me transmettre un genre de message..."Oui"Non"Fossile Armure"Fossile Crâne;["HI like to come here to drink coffee while working on my screenplay."�It's an unflinching narrative about a young woman's journey and her struggle to conform with the authoritan rules laid by society."PIt's an authentic, yet in-your-face look at the intricacies of modern life."2Ah! Is that a regular coffee you're drinking?"CI drink nothing but skinny lattes! My Pokémon loves them too."NWanna see how much better my Pokémon gets when it drinks a skinny latte?"Get ready, let's go!"4I was losing at Pokemon way before it was cool!"SWoah my Pokémon never stood a chance! Even with the aid of that skinny latte!"3I'm impressed! Here, have one, you deserve it!">Yeah, I didn't think you'd be up to the challenge either!"�It's an unflinging narrative about a young woman's journey and her struggle to conform with the authoritan rules laid by society."CAh! I see you've become quite the latte affeccionado yourself!"!Should we have a new battle?"KTwo coffee connoisseurs battling each other, this is going to be good!"DReally!? Some other customer left these two rocks on the table."AI can't believe this is the second time it's happened to me!"Anyway, did you want one?""Okay! Which one did you want?"AWho would leave fossils on a restaurant's table, seriously!?"<Who leaves fossils on a restaurant's table, seriously!?"@I think someone's trying to send me some sort of message..."Yes"No"Armor Fossil"Skull Fossil0Iu;␀�[[#"Guh guhugaugh!"Sluuuuuuurp!"punchline",I'm a clown! I tell jokes for a living!"#Would you like to hear a joke?"2Why doesn't Noctowl care about your problems?"!He doesn't give a Hoot-Hoot!"	joke"So, did you like it?"'You can leave a tip if you want..."That's no problem!"Thank you!"2Come back when you want to hear another joke!"(Oh my, you don't have enough money."@You know what? Keep that money. You need it more than I do!"9\^Hello,